ontent__K5K7M"><header><h1>Find All Permutations</h1></header><div class=3D=
"style_problemDescription__T4cPe"><p>Return <strong>all possible permutatio=
ns</strong> of a given array of unique integers. They can be returned in an=
y order.</p><h4 id=3D"example">Example:</h4><pre><code class=3D"hljs langua=
ge-python">Input: nums =3D [<span class=3D"hljs-number">4</span>, <span cla=
